alice programs vendored for integration testing
=================================================

the `.in` files in this directory are alice programs sourced verbatim
from the `examples/` directory of the upstream alice repository:

  https://github.com/m-ender/alice
  copy is at internal/integrationtest/testdata/gems/alice/

each `.in` is the corresponding `<name>.alice` from `examples/`,
renamed so the goruby esolang test harness (which globs `*.in`)
picks them up. the sibling `.expected` files were generated by
running the multi-file interpreter

  ruby internal/integrationtest/testdata/gems/alice/interpreter.rb \
       <fixture>.in </dev/null > <fixture>.expected

under MRI 2.6.10.

omitted programs and why
------------------------

- fibonacci-loop.alice -- never terminates under either MRI or
  goruby (timeout 124 both sides). no useful baseline to anchor.

